 "issue": 234,
 "issue_title": "Cleanup",
 "issue_body": "- **`getattr` duck-typing in hot loop** (`tracer_2d.py:45-63`, `geometry.py:91,99,131,139`): `Lens` always defines `is_parabolic_*/parabolic_sag_*/get_effective_radius_*` (`lens.py:127-130`). Direct attrs + cache `dx,dy=cos,sin` per `trace_ray` instead of 5-6x recompute.\n- **`lens_editor.py:371-419` reimplements lensmaker** with hardcoded `1e-10` and dead `hasattr(get_effective_radius)` guard. Delete, delegate to `lens.calculate_focal_length/power/BFL/FFL`.\n- **Persistence smuggled in `metadata` blob** (`database.py:68-125,322-325`, `lens.py:323-386`): `user_version=1`, no migration, `INSERT OR REPLACE` without `ON DELETE CASCADE` risks FK orphan of `assembly_elements`. Add `user_version=2` with explicit `is_parabolic_1 INTEGER / parabolic_sag_1 REAL` columns + `Lens.from_dict` hydration test for pre-parabolic DBs.\n- **`generate_mesh` non-manifold** (`geometry.py:152-198`): full `-D/2..D/2` slice revolved \u2192 duplicate verts, bow-tie faces, no center fan/rim skirt. Sample `r in [0, D/2]` + axis fan + rim stitch.\n- **`trace_parallel_rays:346` hidden 95% clip** (`APERTURE_FILL_FACTOR=0.95`): rim SA never traced, viz vs analysis disagree. Make `fill` explicit arg (`1.0` analysis, `0.95` viz only).\n- **Merit scale chaos** (`optimizer.py:139-140,149-150,194,261-262`): `spherical\u21921e6` vs `coma\u21920.0` on empty system vs `rms\u21921e3` on exception. Normalize to one `INFEASIBLE=1e9`; `abs()` signed chromatic LCA.\n",
 "issue_url": "https://github.com/pmaasz/openLens/issues/234",
 "pr": 246,
 "pr_title": "refactor(cleanup): normalize tracers, editor, DB schema, and merit scale",
 "pr_body": "Tracer 2D/3D use direct Lens attributes (drop getattr duck-typing, localize flat double-cos; no cross-stage trig cache as angle mutates on refraction).\r\n\r\nLens editor delegates focal/power/BFL/FFL to Lens model (display parity).\r\n\r\nDatabase user_version=2 with explicit is_parabolic_*/parabolic_sag_* columns, v1->v2 ALTER migration, save/load wired, metadata-excluded.\r\n\r\nParallel-ray fill defaults to 1.0 (APERTURE_FILL_FACTOR stays explicit opt-in for viz fans).\r\n\r\nOptimizer uses single INFEASIBLE_MERIT=1e9 and scores chromatic by abs(LCA).",
 "fix_commit": "5474ab3552705c54c01488b1c007df6b1cfd6b91",
